  m_text: 'With each win, a set amount of coin will be added to Piggy. When the minimum
    amount is met, you will be able to break Piggy to get all the coin.


    <color=red>Piggy
    cannot hold more than the maximum amount of coin, any coin get added afterward
    will be lost, you need to break Piggy before getting more!</color>

    <color=green>Don''t
    worry, Piggy will be fixed up immediately after each time you break him.</color>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
